# The build context of dist/Dockerfile, the checkout, less what no build of
# the hosts reads: cargo's targets, Python's bytecode, git's and the
# sessions' state, and the research and census records (BuildKit reads this
# file for that Dockerfile alone).
**/target
**/__pycache__
.git
.claude
research
# The compiled tier's build reads this extracted native table.
data/*
!data/func-infos.toml
**/.DS_Store
